    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第1問　小問集合（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　真数条件を先に固定する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "対数の真数から \\(|x-1|>0\\) かつ \\(x>0\\) を得ます。したがって \\(0<x<1\\) と \\(x>1\\) に分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\log_4|x-1|=\\frac12\\log_2|x-1|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "16|x-1|>x^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(x>1\\) では \\(x^2-16x+16<0\\)、\\(0<x<1\\) では \\(x^2+16x-16<0\\) を解き、真数条件との共通部分を取ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "0<x<-8+4\\sqrt5",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "8-4\\sqrt3<x<8+4\\sqrt3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a02-inequality-graphs",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　ゼロ関数の場合を分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "まず \\(b=0\\) なら \\(y=0\\) なので、任意の実数 \\(a\\) で微分方程式を満たします。以下は \\(b\\ne0\\) とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y'=e^{ax}(a\\sin bx+b\\cos bx)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y''=e^{ax}\\{(a^2-b^2)\\sin bx+2ab\\cos bx\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "微分方程式へ代入し、\\(x=0\\) を入れると \\(a=1\\) です。続いて正弦が1となる値を入れると \\(b=\\pm2\\) を得ます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "b=0,\\qquad a\\in\\mathbb R",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(a,b)=(1,2)\\quad\\text{または}\\quad(1,-2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　○と仕切りで整数解を数える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "非負整数解は20個の○と2個の仕切りの並べ方、正整数解は20個の○の間19か所から仕切り2個を選ぶ問題です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_{22}C_2=231,\\qquad{}_{19}C_2=171",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　差の条件で一変数化する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(y=x-\\pi/3\\) と置くと、角の範囲から \\(\\pi/3\\le x<\\pi\\) です。倍角公式で一つの正弦にまとめます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sin^2x+\\cos^2y=1+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\sin\\left(2x-\\frac\\pi3\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A=2x-\\frac\\pi3,\\qquad\\frac\\pi3\\le A<\\frac{5\\pi}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "指定範囲には \\(\\sin A=1\\) と \\(\\sin A=-1\\) の両方が含まれます。対応する \\(A\\) を \\(x\\) へ戻します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=\\frac{5\\pi}{12}\\Rightarrow1+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\Rightarrow1-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "確認",
            "text": "最大値・最小値だけでなく、そのときの \\(x\\) まで書きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5)　直径ABの円を見つける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "直角三角形から \\(AB=10\\)、正方形から \\(AE=5\\sqrt2\\) です。\\(\\angle AEB=\\angle AFB=\\pi/2\\) なので、EとFは直径ABの円周上にあります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\angle AFE=\\angle ABE=\\frac\\pi4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(5\\sqrt2)^2=6^2+EF^2-2\\cdot6\\cdot EF\\cos\\frac\\pi4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "EF=7\\sqrt2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a06-geometry-diagrams",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "別解の見方",
            "text": "同じ円に内接する四角形へトレミーの定理を使う方法や、座標を置いて距離を計算する方法でも同じ結果になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AB\\cdot EF=AE\\cdot BF+AF\\cdot BE",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a07-geometry-alternatives",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　食塩水と連立漸化式（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　濃度を食塩量へ直す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "200\\cdot\\frac a{100}+300\\cdot\\frac b{100}=2a+3b\\ [\\mathrm g]",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　移動を順番に追う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "表にする量",
            "text": "各段階でAとBの全体量、食塩量、濃度を分けて書きます。Bで混ぜてから戻す順序を崩さないことが重要です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Aから100 gを移した後、Bは400 gです。その濃度で100 gをAへ戻すため、次の連立漸化式になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x_n=\\frac58x_{n-1}+\\frac38y_{n-1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y_n=\\frac14x_{n-1}+\\frac34y_{n-1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　保存量を一次結合で示す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "s_n=2x_n+3y_n",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "s_n=s_{n-1}=\\cdots=s_0=2a+3b",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　平衡値を引いて等比数列にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(c=2a+3b\\) とおき、保存量から \\(y_n=c/3-2x_n/3\\) を漸化式へ代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x_n-\\frac c5=\\frac38\\left(x_{n-1}-\\frac c5\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x_n=\\frac{2a+3b}{5}+\\frac{3a-3b}{5}\\left(\\frac38\\right)^n",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y_n=\\frac{2a+3b}{5}+\\frac{2b-2a}{5}\\left(\\frac38\\right)^n",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(5)　公比の極限を取る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(0<3/8<1\\) なので等比部分は0へ収束し、AとBの濃度はどちらも同じ平衡値へ近づきます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim x_n=\\lim y_n=\\frac{2a+3b}{5}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p011",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "全体像",
            "text": "極限値は500 gすべてを混ぜたときの濃度と一致します。ただし、証明では連立漸化式と保存量を使う流れを保ちます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　複素数平面上の外心と回転（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　比が実数となる条件",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "O、A、Bが同一直線上にあることは \\(\\beta/\\alpha\\) が実数であることと同値です。共役と等しい条件へ直します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac\\beta\\alpha=\\overline{\\left(\\frac\\beta\\alpha\\right)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\bar\\alpha\\beta=\\alpha\\bar\\beta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　外心の等距離条件を展開する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p012",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "外心CはO、A、Bから等距離なので、二つの等距離式を2乗して共役を含む一次式へ整理します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\bar\\alpha\\gamma+\\alpha\\bar\\gamma=\\alpha\\bar\\alpha",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\bar\\beta\\gamma+\\beta\\bar\\gamma=\\beta\\bar\\beta",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "第一式に \\(\\beta\\)、第二式に \\(\\alpha\\) を掛けて差を取ります。非共線条件により分母は0ではありません。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\gamma=\\frac{\\alpha\\beta(\\bar\\alpha-\\bar\\beta)}{\\bar\\alpha\\beta-\\alpha\\bar\\beta}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p013",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(a)　円周角から中心角へ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\alpha=1\\) は実軸上、\\(\\beta=\\sqrt3+3i\\) の偏角は \\(\\pi/3\\) です。したがって原点角は \\(\\pi/3\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\angle AOB=\\frac\\pi3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\theta=\\angle ACB=2\\angle AOB=\\frac{2\\pi}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a13-complex-geometry",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p014",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(b)　点列を45度回転として読む",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(|\\omega|=1\\)、偏角は \\(\\pi/4\\) です。したがって \\(z_n\\) はCを中心にAを45度ずつ反時計回りに回転した点です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "z_n=(\\alpha-\\gamma)\\omega^n+\\gamma",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "8回で一周するため、点は8種類だけです。図からBに最も近いのはAから3回回転した位置です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "n=8m+3\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb Z)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a14-eight-points",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p015",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "式で確かめる場合",
            "text": "距離を回転角の差へ直し、\\(n\\) を8で割った余りごとに比較します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|z_n-\\beta|=2|\\alpha-\\gamma|\\left|\\sin\\left(\\frac{n\\pi}{8}-\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\right|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "余り0から7を比較すると、角度差の絶対値が最小なのは余り3です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "hyogo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p016",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "n\\equiv3\\pmod8",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "答案の要点",
            "text": "複素数の積を回転として図形的に読むと短く解けます。式による比較でも、周期8を先に押さえると計算範囲を限定できます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
